  "question": {
    "text": "Among the electrolytes $\\mathrm{Na}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4, \\mathrm{CaCl}_2 \\quad \\mathrm{Al}_2\\left(\\mathrm{SO}_4\\right)_3$ and $\\mathrm{NH}_4 \\mathrm{Cl}$, the most effective coagulating agent for $\\mathrm{Sb}_2 \\mathrm{~S}_3$ sol is",
